  "description": "Durable Frame\n\nUltra light aluminum rigid frame is strong and durable; Both frame and suspension fork are capable of absorbing shocks, providing you with a stable and comfortable riding experience on trails, mountain roads, city streets, etc\n\nVersatile 21 Speed Drivetrain\n\nThe 21-speed drivetrain gives young adventurers plenty of range to tackle climbs and smooth acceleration on the flat, building confidence and independence while riding\n\nInstant Braking Response\n\nDisc brakes provide instant stopping power for quick response in any situation, maintaining consistent performance in wet, muddy or icy conditions for increased safety in adverse weather conditions\n\nSports Tires\n\nDouble-walled alloy rims are strong and withstand the bumps of off-road riding; 26-inch all-terrain tyres roll faster to get through trails, make driving effortless and non-slip, handle pavement, dirt with ease\n\nEasy to Install\n\nMen's and women's mountain bikes are 85% pre-assembled; Easy to assemble with free pedals and all necessary assembly tools; 26\" adult bike is suitable for a person 5'-6' tall\n\nElevate your trail experience with the Hiland Zeal Mountain Bike. Featuring a lightweight aluminum frame, 21-speed drivetrain, and front suspension for smooth off-road performance. Shop now!",
